{"id":"7a7888e53e3d006d","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-validity-at-all-stages.md","title":"Theorem — 全局有效性与所有阶段有效性","display":"Theorem — 全局有效性与所有阶段有效性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-validity-at-all-stages","aliases":["14-thm-validity-at-all-stages"],"display":"Theorem — 全局有效性与所有阶段有效性","depends_on":["[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-validity-at-all-stages"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-validity-at-all-stages</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 全局有效性与所有阶段有效性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eeccd7d0ab927af1\" href=\"?note=eeccd7d0ab927af1\" title=\"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing\">14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eeccd7d0ab927af1\" href=\"?note=eeccd7d0ab927af1\" title=\"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing\">14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing</a> 的解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的上下文对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=M_{\\vec x}\">\\(C=M_{\\vec x}\\)</span>，其子对象解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A=\\top_C\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(C,1_C,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U,C)\\ \\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(U,\\alpha,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A=\\top_C\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(C,1_C,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U,C)\\ \\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(U,\\alpha,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：全子对象的分类映射为 ⊤!C，故对任意 α 强制；反向选 U=C、α=1_C。只检查全局元素 Hom(1,C) 在一般拓扑斯中不足，必须允许全部广义阶段。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"eeccd7d0ab927af1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"eeccd7d0ab927af1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-kripke-joyal-forcing]] 的解释；$\\varphi$ 的上下文对象为 $C=M_{\\vec x}$，其子对象解释为 $A$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"C=M_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\top_C\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(C,1_C,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\forall\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(U,C)\\ \\mathrm{Forces}_{\\mathcal E,M,\\vec x}(U,\\alpha,\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1011,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-245","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-validity-at-all-stages|Theorem — 全局有效性与所有阶段有效性]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-validity-at-all-stages]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-validity-at-all-stages|Theorem — 全局有效性与所有阶段有效性]]"}],"outgoing":["eeccd7d0ab927af1","a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5"]}